{"video_id": "X3hBGjhJb04", "segment_index": 0, "start_seconds": 0.0, "end_seconds": 3.1600000858306885, "text": "Si no hacemos la paz con las máquinas, nos van a llenar puestos.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "X3hBGjhJb04", "segment_index": 1, "start_seconds": 3.1600000858306885, "end_seconds": 5.360000133514404, "text": "Pensá que la biología a escala humana no cambia.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "X3hBGjhJb04", "segment_index": 2, "start_seconds": 5.360000133514404, "end_seconds": 6.880000114440918, "text": "La máquina mejora todos los años.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "X3hBGjhJb04", "segment_index": 3, "start_seconds": 6.880000114440918, "end_seconds": 9.880000114440918, "text": "Entonces, en algún momento, las máquinas van a ser más inteligentes que nosotros.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "X3hBGjhJb04", "segment_index": 4, "start_seconds": 9.880000114440918, "end_seconds": 13.760000228881836, "text": "Si vos querés pensar cómo es vincularte con un ente, aunque sea no biológico,", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "X3hBGjhJb04", "segment_index": 5, "start_seconds": 13.760000228881836, "end_seconds": 14.880000114440918, "text": "más inteligente que nosotros,", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "X3hBGjhJb04", "segment_index": 6, "start_seconds": 14.880000114440918, "end_seconds": 18.0, "text": "observá cómo nos compartamos nosotros con criaturas menos inteligentes.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "X3hBGjhJb04", "segment_index": 7, "start_seconds": 18.0, "end_seconds": 18.84000015258789, "text": "Y en eso hay tres grupos.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "X3hBGjhJb04", "segment_index": 8, "start_seconds": 18.84000015258789, "end_seconds": 20.079999923706055, "text": "En un extremo, tenés los mosquitos.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "X3hBGjhJb04", "segment_index": 9, "start_seconds": 20.079999923706055, "end_seconds": 22.239999771118164, "text": "Si los hubiéramos podido exterminar, ya lo hubiéramos hecho.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "X3hBGjhJb04", "segment_index": 10, "start_seconds": 22.239999771118164, "end_seconds": 24.440000534057617, "text": "Porque nos molestan, porque nos pican, porque nos suman en la oreja,", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "X3hBGjhJb04", "segment_index": 11, "start_seconds": 24.440000534057617, "end_seconds": 25.520000457763672, "text": "porque transmiten enfermedades.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "X3hBGjhJb04", "segment_index": 12, "start_seconds": 25.520000457763672, "end_seconds": 26.760000228881836, "text": "En el medio tenés las lombrices.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "X3hBGjhJb04", "segment_index": 13, "start_seconds": 26.760000228881836, "end_seconds": 28.15999984741211, "text": "Vas caminando, pisaste una lombriz.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "X3hBGjhJb04", "segment_index": 14, "start_seconds": 28.200000762939453, "end_seconds": 30.200000762939453, "text": "Nunca irías a tratar de matar una lombriz.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "X3hBGjhJb04", "segment_index": 15, "start_seconds": 30.200000762939453, "end_seconds": 33.0, "text": "Pero mataste una y tampoco te vas a amargar el día porque pisaste una lombriz.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "X3hBGjhJb04", "segment_index": 16, "start_seconds": 33.0, "end_seconds": 33.7599983215332, "text": "Seguís caminando.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "X3hBGjhJb04", "segment_index": 17, "start_seconds": 33.7599983215332, "end_seconds": 35.63999938964844, "text": "En el extremo contrario, los pandas.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "X3hBGjhJb04", "segment_index": 18, "start_seconds": 35.63999938964844, "end_seconds": 36.52000045776367, "text": "Nos encantan.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "X3hBGjhJb04", "segment_index": 19, "start_seconds": 36.52000045776367, "end_seconds": 39.20000076293945, "text": "Los amamos, haríamos lo que sea, creamos santuarios,", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "X3hBGjhJb04", "segment_index": 20, "start_seconds": 39.20000076293945, "end_seconds": 41.0, "text": "les damos bambú para que se reproduzcan.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "X3hBGjhJb04", "segment_index": 21, "start_seconds": 41.0, "end_seconds": 42.47999954223633, "text": "Hay un componente caprichoso y arbitrario,", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "X3hBGjhJb04", "segment_index": 22, "start_seconds": 42.47999954223633, "end_seconds": 45.47999954223633, "text": "y otro que tiene que ver con que los mosquitos te transmiten la malaria, te pican.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "X3hBGjhJb04", "segment_index": 23, "start_seconds": 45.47999954223633, "end_seconds": 47.599998474121094, "text": "¿Quién vamos a ser nosotros para ellas?", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "X3hBGjhJb04", "segment_index": 24, "start_seconds": 47.599998474121094, "end_seconds": 49.560001373291016, "text": "¿Mosquitos, pandas o lombrices?", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "X3hBGjhJb04", "segment_index": 25, "start_seconds": 49.560001373291016, "end_seconds": 51.119998931884766, "text": "Yo trataría de ser lombriz.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
